This package does not bundle third-party rule files. On first use it downloads
the following artifacts from GitHub, verifies their SHA-256 checksums and
stores them in a local cache (~/.cache/erechnung or ERECHNUNG_CACHE):

1. XRechnung validator configuration 3.0.2 (release v2026-08-31)
   https://github.com/itplr-kosit/validator-configuration-xrechnung
   Koordinierungsstelle für IT-Standards (KoSIT), Apache License 2.0.
   Contains the XRechnung Schematron (Apache License 2.0) and the
   EN 16931 validation artifacts of CEN/TC 434 (European Union Public
   Licence 1.2, https://github.com/ConnectingEurope/eInvoicing-EN16931),
   as well as the UBL 2.1 (OASIS) and UN/CEFACT CII D16B XML schemas.

2. XRechnung visualization 3.0.2 (release v2026-10-13)
   https://github.com/itplr-kosit/xrechnung-visualization
   KoSIT, Apache License 2.0.

For development and CI only (scripts/), the following are downloaded:

3. XRechnung test suite 3.0.2 (release v2026-08-31)
   https://github.com/itplr-kosit/xrechnung-testsuite, KoSIT, Apache License 2.0.
4. KoSIT validator 1.6.3, https://github.com/itplr-kosit/validator, Apache License 2.0.
5. Mustang CLI 2.26.0, https://github.com/ZUGFeRD/mustangproject, Apache License 2.0.

Runtime dependencies: lxml (BSD-3-Clause), pypdf (BSD-3-Clause),
saxonche / SaxonC-HE (Mozilla Public License 2.0, optional extra "offiziell"),
mcp (MIT, optional extra "mcp").

Ghostscript (Artifex Software, AGPL-3.0) is optionally called as an external
program and is not part of this package. The example PDFs under beispiele/
were created with it. They contain subsets of the URW base 35 fonts (Nimbus
Sans, embedded under the names Helvetica and Helvetica-Bold; AGPL-3.0 with
font exception) and the "Artifex Software sRGB ICC Profile" (Copyright
Artifex Software 2011).

Column layout of the DATEV EXTF booking batch cross-checked against
ledermann/datev (MIT), https://github.com/ledermann/datev.
DATEV is a trademark of DATEV eG. XRechnung is a standard of KoSIT.
ZUGFeRD is a standard of Forum elektronische Rechnung Deutschland (FeRD).
This project is not affiliated with any of them.
